original_text: ["After you're attacked, before you declare blockers, you may tap Kongming's Contraptions to have it deal 2 damage to any one attacking creature.", 'All your creatures gain horsemanship as long as Sun Quan is in play. (This includes Sun Quan.)', 'All your creatures get +1/+1 until the end of the turn.', 'All your creatures get +2/+0 until the end of the turn.', 'All your other creatures get +1/+1 as long as Kongming is in play.', 'All your other green creatures get +1/+1 as long as Meng Huo is in play.', 'Any one creature gets +2/+2 and gains horsemanship.', 'Any one creature gets +3/+3 and gains horsemanship until the end of the turn.', 'Any one creature gets +4/+4 until the end of the turn.', 'As long as your opponent has an island in play, Wu Admiral gets +1/+1.', "At the beginning of your opponent's next turn, he or she skips untapping creatures and lands.", "Attacking doesn't cause Alert Shu Infantry to tap.", 'B', 'Blaze deals X damage to any one creature or player.', 'Borrowing the East Wind deals X damage to each player and each creature with horsemanship. (This includes you and your creatures with horsemanship.)', 'Burning Fields deals 5 damage to your opponent.', 'Choose any one creature. This turn, all creatures able to block it do so.', 'Desert Sandstorm deals 1 damage to each creature. (This includes your creatures.)', 'Destroy all lands. (This includes your lands.)', 'Destroy all tapped creatures. (This includes your tapped creatures.)', "Destroy all your opponent's creatures. you draw a card for each creature destroyed in this way.", "Destroy any one creature that isn't black.", "Destroy any one creature that isn't black. You gain 3 life.", 'Destroy any one creature with horsemanship.', "Destroy any one creature. That creature's owner gains 4 life.", 'Destroy any one land.', 'Destroy any one tapped creature.', 'Draw four cards and put them into your hand. Then discard three cards at random from your hand.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Draw three cards. You lose 3 life.', 'Famine deals 3 damage to each creature and player. (This includes your creatures and you.)', 'Fire Ambush deals 3 damage to any one creature or player.', 'For each creature you have in play, you gain 2 life.', 'For each tapped creature your opponent has in play, you draw a card.', "Forestwalk (If defending player has a forest in play, Zodaic Monkey can't be blocked.)", "Forestwalk (If defending player has a forest in play, Zodiac Hare can't be blocked.)", "Forestwalk (If defending player has a forest in play, Zodiac Tiger can't be blocked.)", 'G', 'Horsemanship', 'Horsemanship\\nAs long as you have Guan Yu and/or Zhang Fei in play, Liu Bei gets +2/+2.', "Horsemanship\\nAttacking doesn't cause Shu General to tap.", "Horsemanship\\nAttacking doesn't cause Zhang Fei to tap.", "Horsemanship\\nEach of your creatures can't be blocked by more than one creature each turn as long as Yuan Shao is in play.", 'Horsemanship\\nLu Bu is unaffected by summoning sickness.', 'Horsemanship\\nOn your turn, before you attack, you may put Xiahou Dun into your graveyard to return a black card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Horsemanship\\nWhen Cao Ren comes into play, you lose 3 life.', 'Horsemanship\\nWhen Guan Yu is put into your graveyard from play, you may shuffle Guan Yu into your library.', 'Horsemanship\\nWhen Lu Xun successfully damages your opponent, you may draw a card.', "Horsemanship\\nWhen Sun Ce comes into play, you may return any one creature from play to its owner's hand.", "Horsemanship\\nWhen Wei Night Raiders successfully damages your opponent, he or she chooses and discards a card from his or her hand. (Ignore this effect if your opponent doesn't have any cards.)", "Horsemanship\\nWhen Wu Scout comes into play, look at your opponent's hand.", 'Horsemanship\\nWhen Zhang He attacks, all your other creatures get +1/+0 until the end of the turn.', 'Horsemanship\\nWhen Zhao Zilong blocks, it gets +1/+1 until the end of the turn.', "Horsemanship\\nWhenever Ma Chao attacks and no other creatures do, Ma Chao can't be blocked.", "Horsemanship\\nYellow Scarves Cavalry can't block.", "Horsemanship\\nYellow Scarves General can't block.", "Huang Zhong can't be blocked by more than one creature each turn.", 'If Zodiac Dragon is put into your graveyard, you may return Zodiac Dragon to your hand.', "If you have fewer cards in your hand than your opponent does, you draw until you have the same number. (When you play Balance of Power it doesn't count as in your hand.)", "Islandwalk (If defending player has an island in play, Zodiac Horse can't be blocked.)", 'Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', "Look at your opponent's hand and choose a card from it. Your opponent discards that card.", 'Mountain Bandit is unaffected by summoning sickness.', "Mountainwalk (If defending player has a mountain in play, Zodiac Dog can't be blocked.)", "Mountainwalk (If defending player has a mountain in play, Zodiac Goat can't be blocked.)", 'On your turn, before you attack you may put Loyal Retainers in your graveyard to take any one Legend card from your graveyard and put that creature into play.', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may destroy Fire Bowman to have it deal 1 damage to any one creature or player.', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Cao Cao to force your opponent to choose and discard two cards from his or her hand. (If your opponent has only one card, he or she discards it.)', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Cunning Advisor to force your opponent to choose and discard a card from his or her hand.', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Diaochan to destroy any one creature. Then, your opponent destroys any one creature of his or her choice.', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Hua Tuo to put any one creature card from your graveyard on the top of your library.', "On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Lady Sun to return it and any one other creature to their owners' hands.", 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Lu Su to draw a card.', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Pang Tong to give any one creature +0/+2 until the end of the turn.', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Shu Farmer to gain 1 life.', "On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Stone Catapult to destroy any one tapped creature that isn't black.", 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Wu Longbowman to have it deal 1 damage to any one creature or player.', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Xun Yu to give one of your creatures +2/+0 until the end of the turn.', 'On your turn, before you attack, you may tap Zhuge Jin to make any one creature unblockable this turn.', "Plainswalk (If defending player has a plain in play, Zodiac Rooster can't be blocked.)", "Play Champion's Victory only after you're attacked, before you declare blockers.\\nReturn any one attacking creature to its owner's hand.", "Play Eightfold Maze only after you're attacked, before you declare blockers.\\nDestroy any one attacking creature.", 'Play Extinguish only in response to another player playing a sorcery.\\nThat sorcery has no effect, and that player puts it into his or her graveyard.', "Play Heavy Fog only after you're attacked, before you declare blockers.\\nThis turn, all damage dealt to you by attacking creatures is reduced to 0.", 'Play Mystic Denial only in response to another player playing a creature or a sorcery. That card has no effect, and that player puts it into his or her graveyard.', 'Play Preemptive Strike only in response to another player playing a creature card.\\nThat creature has no effect, and that player puts it into his or her graveyard.', "Play Rally the Troops only after you're attacked, before you declare blockers.\\nUntap all your creatures.", "Play Warrior's Stand only after you're attacked, before you declare blockers.\\nAll your creatures get +2/+2 until the end of the turn.", 'R', "Red Cliffs Armada can't attack unless the defending player has an island in play.", 'Renegade Troops is unaffected by summoning sickness.', 'Return any one creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return any one creature from play to the top of its owner's library.", "Return any one or two creatures to their owner's hand.", 'Return any one sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Rockslide Ambush deals to any one creature damage equal to the number of mountain cards you have in play. (This includes both tapped and untapped mountain cards.)', 'Rolling Earthquake deals X damage to each player and each creature without horsemanship. (This includes you and your creatures without horsemanship.)', 'Search your library for a forest card and put that forest into play. Shuffle your library afterward.', 'Search your library for a plains, island, swamp, mountain, or forest card and put that land into play. Shuffle your library afterward.', 'Search your library for any one card. Shuffle your library and put that card on top of it. You lose 2 life.', 'Sima Yi has power equal to the number of swamp cards you have in play. (This includes both tapped and untapped swamp cards.)', "Stalking Tiger can't be blocked by more than one creature each turn.", 'Stolen Grain deals 5 damage to your opponent. You gain 5 life.', "Swampwalk (If defending player has a swamp in play, Zodiac Ox can't be blocked.)", "Swampwalk (If defending player has a swamp in play, Zodiac Pig can't be blocked.)", "Swampwalk (If defending player has a swamp in play, Zodiac Rat can't be blocked.)", "Swampwalk (If defending player has a swamp in play, Zodiac Snake can't be blocked.)", "Take another turn after this one. At the end of that turn, you lose the game. (You don't lose if you've already won.)", 'Take any one card from your graveyard and put that card on the top of your library.', 'Take any one creature card from your graveyard and put that creature into play.', "Taoist Mystic can't be blocked by creatures with horsemanship.", "Tap any number of your creatures. You gain 4 life for each creature tapped this way. (Tapped creatures can't block.)", "Tap any one or two creatures without horsemanship. (Tapped creatures can't block.)", 'U', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. You may declare an additional attack this turn.', 'W', "When Corrupt Eunuchs comes into play, it deals 2 damage to any one creature. (If you're the only one with creatures, deal the damage to one of them.)", "When Corrupt Official comes into play, your opponent chooses and discards a card from his or her hand. (Ignore this effect if your opponent doesn't have any cards.)", 'When Council of Advisors comes into play, draw a card.', "When Dong Zhou comes into play, choose one of your opponent's creatures. That creature deals damage to him or her equal to its power. (Ignore this effect if your opponent doesn't have any creatures in play.)", "When Flanking Troops attacks, you may tap any one creature. (Tapped creatures can't block.)", 'When Hunting Cheetah successfully damages your opponent, you may search your library for a forest card, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your library afterward.', 'When Imperial Recruiter comes into play, search your library for a creature card with power no greater than 2, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. Shuffle your library afterward.', 'When Lone Wolf attacks and is blocked, you may have it deal its damage to the defending player instead of to the creatures blocking it.', 'When Ravaging Horde comes into play, destroy any one land.', 'When Shu Defender blocks, it gets +0/+2 until the end of the turn.', 'When Shu Grain Caravan comes into play, you gain 2 life.', 'When Shu Soldier-Farmers comes into play, you gain 4 life.', 'When Slashing Tiger attacks and is blocked, it gets +2/+2 until the end of the turn.', 'When Trained Cheetah attacks and is blocked, it gets +1/+1 until the end of the turn.', 'When Wei Ambush Force attacks, it gets +2/+0 until the end of the turn.', 'When Wei Assassins comes into play, your opponent chooses one of his or her creatures. Destroy that creature. (Ignore this effect if your opponent has no creatures in play.)', 'When Wolf Pack attacks and is blocked, you may have it deal its damage to the defending player instead of to the creatures blocking it.', "When Wu Spy comes into play, look at the top two cards of any player's library. Put one of them on the top of that player's library and the other in his or her graveyard.", "When Zhang Liao successfully damages your opponent, he or she chooses and discard a card from his or her hand. (Ignore this effect if your opponent doesn't have any cards.)", "Whenever Yuan Shao's Infantry attacks and no other creatures do, Yuan Shao's Infantry can't be blocked.", "Whenever your opponent chooses a creature in play, he or she can't choose Taoist Hermit.", "Wu Warship can't attack unless the defending player has an island in play.", "Yellow Scarves Troops can't block.", 'You destroy four of your lands and your opponent destroys four of his or her lands. Then Burning of Xinye deals 4 damage to each creature. (This includes your creatures.)', 'You gain 8 life.', 'You take another turn after this one.', "Young Wei Recruits can't block.", "Your opponent can't attack on his or her next turn.", 'Your opponent chooses and discards two cards from his or her hand. (If your opponent has only one card, he or she discards it.)', 'Your opponent chooses one of his or her creatures. Destroy that creature.', 'Your opponent chooses one of his or her creatures. Only that creature can block this turn.', "Zhou Yu can't attack unless your opponent has an island in play.", "Zuo Ci can't be blocked by creatures with horsemanship.\\nWhenever your opponent chooses a creature in play, he or she can't choose Zuo Ci."]
